== relational schema
Relational schema
Notation: _name_ primary key, /name/ foreign key, _/name/_ both

Workshop : {(_workshopId_ : integer)}
Room : {(_roomId_ : integer)}
Workshop_heldIn_Room : {(_/workshopId/_ : integer, /roomId/ : integer, _date_ : date)}

Foreign keys
  Workshop_heldIn_Room.workshopId -> Workshop.workshopId
  Workshop_heldIn_Room.roomId -> Room.roomId

Not enforced by the schema
